<html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><style>
body{font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:#111827;line-height:1.7;max-width:860px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 28px}
h1{font-size:22pt;color:#111827;border-bottom:3px solid #c5a028;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:4px}
h2{font-size:14pt;color:#111827;margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:4px;border-left:4px solid #4fd1c5;padding-left:12px;background:#f4fdfc}
h3{font-size:12pt;color:#374151;margin:16px 0 4px;font-weight:bold}
p{margin:4px 0 10px}
.meta{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:10pt}
.meta p{margin:3px 0}
.meta strong{color:#b7881c}
.sec{border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;margin-top:28px;padding-top:16px}
.badge{display:inline-block;background:#ecfdf5;color:#065f46;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}
.card{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;margin:10px 0}
.card-title{font-weight:bold;font-size:11.5pt;color:#111827;margin:0 0 4px}
.card-sub{font-size:10pt;color:#6b7280;margin:0 0 4px;font-style:italic}
.card-desc{color:#374151;margin:0;font-size:10.5pt}
.step{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px 14px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0}
.step-num{font-size:18pt;font-weight:bold;color:#c5a028;min-width:40px;line-height:1}
.step-body .step-title{font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;color:#111827;margin:0 0 3px}
.step-body .step-desc{font-size:10.5pt;color:#374151;margin:0}
.faq{border-left:3px solid #4fd1c5;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0}
.faq-q{font-weight:bold;color:#111827;margin:0 0 5px}
.faq-a{color:#374151;margin:0;font-size:10.5pt}
.cta{background:#111827;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 24px;margin-top:28px}
.cta h2{color:#4fd1c5;border:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 8px;background:transparent;font-size:15pt}
.cta p{color:#d1d5db;margin:4px 0}
.cta .btn{display:inline-block;background:#4fd1c5;color:#111827;font-weight:bold;padding:7px 16px;border-radius:5px;margin-top:8px;font-size:10pt}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:10.5pt}
td{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb}
td:first-child{color:#6b7280}
td:last-child{font-weight:bold;color:#111827;text-align:right}
ul{padding-left:18px}
ul li{padding:2px 0;color:#374151}
</style></head><body><h1>Home</h1><div class="meta"><p><strong>Page Title:</strong> Madison, WI Mortgage Lender | Home Loans 2026 | Rob Miller | MadCity Home Loans</p><p><strong>Meta Description:</strong> MadCity Home Loans — Rob Miller, Senior Loan Officer in Madison, WI. Licensed in 11 states. Expert FHA, VA, conventional, jumbo, USDA & WHEDA loans in 2026. Fast closings, local expertise. Call 608-227-2002.</p></div><div class="sec"><h2>Loan Programs</h2><div class="card"><p class="card-title">FHA Loans</p><p class="card-desc">As low as 3.5% down. Perfect for first-time buyers or those rebuilding credit in 2026. Government-backed with flexible qualification standards.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">VA Loans</p><p class="card-desc">Zero down payment for eligible veterans, active duty, and surviving spouses. No PMI, competitive rates, and a lender who honors your service.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Conventional Loans</p><p class="card-desc">Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac-backed loans with as little as 3% down. Flexible terms and automatic PMI cancellation at 80% LTV.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Jumbo Loans</p><p class="card-desc">Financing above the $832,750 conforming limit for high-value Wisconsin properties. Up to $3M+ with competitive fixed and ARM options.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">USDA Loans</p><p class="card-desc">Zero down payment for eligible rural and suburban Wisconsin homes. Income limits apply — check your 2026 eligibility today.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">WHEDA Loans</p><p class="card-desc">Wisconsin's exclusive program offers below-market interest rates and down payment assistance for state residents.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">Non-Conventional</p><p class="card-desc">Bank statement loans, DSCR investor loans, and asset-depletion products for borrowers who don't fit the traditional mold.</p></div><div class="card"><p class="card-title">View All Loan Programs</p><p class="card-desc">Compare all mortgage solutions side-by-side, including FHA, VA, Conventional, Jumbo, USDA, WHEDA, and Non-QM products.</p></div></div><div class="sec"><h2>Key Stats</h2><p><strong>20+</strong> — Years Experience</p><p><strong>1k+</strong> — Families Helped</p><p><strong>11</strong> — States Licensed</p><p><strong>5.0</strong> — Google Rating</p></div><div class="sec"><h2>Steps</h2><div class="step"><div class="step-num">01</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Strategy Session</p><p class="step-desc">A no-pressure call to discuss your 2026 goals, explore loan programs, and define your buying power.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">02</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">Verified Pre-Approval</p><p class="step-desc">We perform a comprehensive review of your financial picture to give you a pre-approval as strong as cash.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">03</div><div class="step-body"><p class="step-title">The Finish Line</p><p class="step-desc">From contract to closing — Rob's team manages every detail for a stress-free, on-time keys-in-hand day.</p></div></div></div><div class="sec"><h2>Hero Section</h2><h3>SECURE YOUR FUTURE. DREAM HOME.</h3><p>Expert mortgage strategy for the 2026 Wisconsin real estate market. Experience absolute transparency, lightning-fast closings, and local expertise that wins.</p></div><div class="sec"><h2>Main Page Content</h2><h3>THE NUMBERS THAT DEFINE US.</h3><h3>SELECT YOUR PATH.</h3><h3>ROB MILLER HOME LOAN TEAM.</h3><h3>TAILORED MORTGAGE SOLUTIONS.</h3><h4>First-Time Buyers</h4><h4>Purchase Strategy</h4><h4>Refinance & Rate Drop</h4><h4>Mortgage Planning</h4><h3>ROADMAP TO CLOSING.</h3><h3>THE CLASSROOM & INSIGHTS.</h3><h4>Home Loan Webinars</h4><h4>Insights & Blog Posts</h4><h4>Downloadable Guidebooks</h4><h3>LICENSED NATIONWIDE.</h3><p>Choose from our comprehensive mortgage programs tailored for Wisconsin home buyers and investors.</p><p>The Rob Miller Home Loan Team at ProVisor, Inc. has spent 20+ years simplifying the mortgage process for families across Wisconsin and the Midwest. Combining national lending power with the dedicated care and local presence of a Madison neighbor, our processors, coordinators, and advisors deliver seamless, on-time, keys-in-hand closings.</p><p>Whether you are buying your first home, upgrading to a new property, refinancing, or planning your wealth, we design custom mortgage strategies built for your specific financial goals in Wisconsin.</p><p>Unlock specialized down payment assistance and WHEDA loan programs. Get direct coaching to navigate the Wisconsin home buying process with confidence.</p><p>Win in Madison's competitive housing market with a pre-approval letter as strong as cash. Experience direct lender strategy and local advocacy.</p><p>Optimize your current rate, drop private mortgage insurance, or pull cash out of your home equity to fund home renovations or consolidate debts.</p><p>Explore comprehensive wealth strategy with custom sessions designed to model your cash-to-close, points evaluation, and long-term equity growth.</p><p>We've removed the friction from the mortgage process so you can focus on your new home.</p><p>Home loans shouldn't be confusing. Access our complete library of video tutorials, live webinar schedules, and downloadable guides to master the lending process.</p><p>Join our next live webinar or explore recordings. Learn how to optimize down payments, qualify for FHA, and maximize tax benefits in 2026.</p><p>Stay updated with the latest Wisconsin mortgage rates, market trends, expert interviews, and strategic homebuyer advice.</p><p>Get free, step-by-step buyer guidebooks and checklists covering credit improvement, first-time buying, and refinance strategies.</p><p>Based in Madison, WI | Serving Homeowners in 11 States</p><p>Our Madison office serves the entire Dane County area including Middleton, Sun Prairie, and Verona. Remote digital closings available for all licensed states.</p><ul><li>Direct, 24/7 access to Rob Miller and our advisory team</li><li>Pre-approvals that local Madison Realtors trust and respect</li><li>Dedicated processing coordinators working on your file daily</li><li>Specialized local expertise in FHA, VA, WHEDA, and Jumbo loans</li><li>Completely transparent, "No-Surprise" closing fee estimates</li></ul></div><div class="cta"><h2>Experience a Smarter Path to Homeownership</h2><p>Don</p><span class="btn">Start Your Secure Application</span></div></body></html>